OL,3,GNEWSAThe teen entrepreneur transforming
OL,4,Afarm management
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe entrepreneur had previously
OL,7,Fdeveloped a mail order gift business at
OL,8,Fthe age of 13. After selling that last
OL,9,Fyear, he turned his talents to managing
OL,10,Ffarm tasks.
